  narrationBits:
  - typingLettersPerSec: 0.05
    textNarration: "Cam the coyote is begrudgingly tagging along with a gaggle of
      people she wouldn\u2019t call friends (Darren, Luis, and Crystal), but the
      only people she knows: old high school acquaintances. People who have their
      lives figured out or have resigned not to. Suburb brats with no connection
      to nature, and no disgust for the sprawl of San Cemento with which anyone from
      a greener place is born. The group is exploring some abandoned plaza, a dime
      a dozen, when Cam veers away to inspect a shuttered oddity shop. \r\n"
    nextNarratorBit: []
